@startuml
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam dpi 180
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0

title Sequence: Dashboard Load

actor Tester
participant Frontend
participant API
participant ReportController
participant ReportService
participant ReportRepository
participant ExecutionController
participant ExecutionService
participant ExecutionRepository
participant TestCaseController
participant TestCaseService
participant TestCaseRepository
participant Database

Tester -> Frontend: Navigate /dashboard
Frontend -> API: GET /api/reports/overview
API -> ReportController: getOverview()
ReportController -> ReportService: getOverview()
ReportService -> ReportRepository: aggregate counts
ReportRepository -> Database: Multiple COUNT queries
Database -> ReportRepository: Counts
ReportRepository -> ReportService: Overview data
ReportService -> ReportController: OverviewDTO
ReportController -> API: 200 OK
API -> Frontend: 200 OK {totalProjects, totalTestCases, ...}

par Executions
  Frontend -> API: GET /api/executions?limit=100
  API -> ExecutionController: list()
  ExecutionController -> ExecutionService: list(1, 100)
  ExecutionService -> ExecutionRepository: list(1, 100, {})
  ExecutionRepository -> Database: SELECT * FROM executions ORDER BY created_at DESC LIMIT 100
  Database -> ExecutionRepository: Executions
  ExecutionRepository -> ExecutionService: Paginated
  ExecutionService -> ExecutionController: Result
  ExecutionController -> API: 200 OK
  API -> Frontend: 200 OK {data: [...], pagination: {...}}
and Test Cases
  Frontend -> API: GET /api/test-cases?type=AUTOMATION&limit=1
  API -> TestCaseController: list()
  TestCaseController -> TestCaseService: list(filters)
  TestCaseService -> TestCaseRepository: list()
  TestCaseRepository -> Database: SELECT * WHERE type='AUTOMATION' LIMIT 1
  Database -> TestCaseRepository: Count
  TestCaseRepository -> TestCaseService: Paginated
  TestCaseService -> TestCaseController: Result
  TestCaseController -> API: 200 OK
  API -> Frontend: 200 OK {pagination: {total: N}}
end

Frontend -> Frontend: Build Execution Trend (group by date, last 14 days)
Frontend -> Frontend: Calculate Pass Rate, Automation Coverage
Frontend -> Tester: Render Dashboard (Stats, Charts, Tables)

@enduml